{"body": "During any period in which there is in effect an agreement entered into pursuant to section 233 of the Social Security Act with any foreign country, wages received by or paid to an individual shall be exempt from the taxes imposed by this section to the extent that such wages are subject under such agreement exclusively to the laws applicable to the social security system of such foreign country.", "citation_label": "26 U.S.C. \u00a7 3101(c)", "citation_path": "us/statute/26/3101/c", "document_class": "statute", "expression_date": "2026-07-12", "heading": "Relief from taxes in cases covered by certain international agreements", "id": "577f9a82-4504-5a31-af1d-a754549e55c6", "identifiers": {"usc:section": "3101", "usc:subsection": "c", "usc:title": "26", "uslm:identifier": "/us/usc/t26/s3101/c"}, "jurisdiction": "us", "kind": "subsection", "language": "en", "legal_identifier": "26 U.S.C. \u00a7 3101(c)", "level": 2, "metadata": {"created_date": "2026-04-17", "heading": "Relief from taxes in cases covered by certain international agreements", "identifier": "/us/usc/t26/s3101/c", "kind": "subsection", "parent_citation_path": "us/statute/26/3101", "publication_name": "Online@119-102", "references_to": [], "section": "3101", "section_heading": "Rate of tax", "source_download_url": "https://uscode.house.gov/download/releasepoints/us/pl/119/102not101/xml_usc26@119-102not101.zip", "subsection": "c", "title": "26", "title_heading": "INTERNAL REVENUE CODE"}, "ordinal": 31010003, "parent_citation_path": "us/statute/26/3101", "parent_id": "a0e0112b-9ca1-57e0-9a5d-7c9062cb1eeb", "source_as_of": "2026-07-12", "source_format": "uslm-xml", "source_id": "/us/usc/t26/s3101/c", "source_path": "sources/us/statute/2026-07-24-1401-coordination-repair-title-26/uslm/usc26.xml", "source_url": "https://uscode.house.gov/view.xhtml?req=granuleid:USC-prelim-title26-section3101&num=0&edition=prelim", "version": "2026-07-24-1401-coordination-repair-title-26"}
